{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The adhesive VELCRO strips fit my interest in mounting things around the home, alongside the screws and drywall anchors I recently explored.",
    "Removable fastening feels useful for a light mounting job on a suitable smooth surface, where I might want to reposition something later."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The filament choices require a printing need that my recent fastening and household maintenance activity does not establish.",
    "The printer and replacement glass bed assume equipment needs or ownership I have not shown, while the caliper is only loosely useful without a current precision measuring task.",
    "Large filament spools and bundles would leave me with supplies I have no concrete use for."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in practical hardware seems to have been stretched into an interest in 3D printing, even though these serve different tasks.",
    "Repeated filament options assume that changing color, finish, or quantity would matter to me before establishing that I need filament at all."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated attention to nails, screws, and anchors points toward fastening and mounting jobs, where dimensions, materials, and tool compatibility matter.",
    "My recent purchases cover specific household needs, including vacuum bags and measuring cups; I need a clear use for each item rather than a broad connection to tools or supplies."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognized my mounting needs but mostly mistook practical hardware interest for an unsupported interest in 3D printing."
}"}
